## Conclusion

An Android TV remote app works by discovering your TV over Wi-Fi using mDNS, pairing securely through the built-in Android TV Remote Service, and communicating key events through the Android TV Input Framework. The result is a fast, flexible, keyboard-equipped remote control that's objectively more capable than the physical remote that came with your TV.

